// "Weapon strikes sear foes with holy energy" -- `Reckless` (damage-up)
// weapon-empowerment stand-in, same substitution shillelagh.ron already
// established. The multi-target on-demand radiant burst rider dropped, no
// on-demand-secondary-attack primitive exists on `SelfBuff`.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Reckless, data: BuffData(strength: 0.3, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 90.0,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Evocation),
        source: Some(Divine),
        // level 5 spell -> min_level 30, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(30)),
    ),
)
